{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"A 52 mill, no jokers. Deal 2–4 players equally; deal one card to three players. The highest card wins every turn; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. If there is a tie, each player in the battle puts one card down and one card up. The highest face-up card takes all cards. If you cannot finish the battle, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly based on luck.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"war-card-game UI copy.fields.summary","detected_language":"tr","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"war-card-game.copy.fields.summary","keys":["war-card-game.copy.fields.summary"],"locale":"tr","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Bir ZXQPH0000QXZ değirmen, joker yok. ZXQPH0001QXZ–ZXQPH0002QXZ oyuncuları arasında eşit olarak dağıtın; üç oyuncu için bir kart ayırın. En yüksek kart her dönüşü kazanır; renkler önemli değil. As yüksek, ZXQPH0003QXZ düşük. Eğer eşitlik olursa, savaştaki her oyuncu bir kart aşağı ve bir kart yukarı koyar. Yüzleri açık en yüksek kart tüm kartları alır. Eğer savaşı tamamlayamazsanız, kaybedersiniz. Oyun uzun olabilir ve çoğunlukla şansa bağlıdır.","record_id":"c6fc65f6c2dbf0df60d7d926fd9bb64d127a932c669f823d69ae42e7e208d753","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.1893003303749907,"source":"One 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly among 2–4 players; set one card aside for three players. Highest card wins each flip; suits do not matter. Ace high, 2 low. On a tie, every player in the battle puts one card down and one up. Highest face-up card takes all. If you cannot complete a war, you lose. The game can be long and is mostly luck.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"1d2ad24094c0a116a056a7c33eca4bc529af719cccd080059fe2e87004f523b7","status":"machine-draft","tran